Acceptance criteria:
README is visually dominated by real screenshots and multiple animated GIFs,
not mockups. No private URL/capability, personal speech, model/native asset,
credential or continuity file enters publication. Demo uses a separate RAM
state/profile and copied numeric cache, sharing only read-only source/model
files and bounded CPU resources. No app defaults change or active runtime restart.
Release is explicitly an early source prerelease, not an installer or accuracy
acceptance; limitations and fresh-clone setup remain reachable.

